  "body": "## Correction\n\nAligns `operations.okf.md` with the live intake law and scheduler state:\n\n- replaces the retired 60% non-deckbuilder factual quota with 100% bounded governing-document coverage plus claim-level Source/Evidence/Confidence;\n- records Bathcat and Mennonite as enabled in their isolated checkouts;\n- removes obsolete automatic rejection-based pausing and records retry-safe fail-closed behavior;\n- preserves the prior 60% instruction as historical provenance rather than presenting it as current law.\n\n## Verification\n\n- focused OKF validation: clean\n- full corpus: 2,637 OKFs clean; index fresh\n- intake suite: 44 passed, 1 intentional skip, 0 failed\n- diff-aware intake gate: clean\n\nNo game content or executable gate changed.",
  "closed_at": "2026-08-02T13:07:51Z",
